{"id": "1531473810539413685", "channel_id": "1531473810539413685", "author_id": "145731220368654336", "author_name": "cyberse7en", "content": "Since patch 2.5.3.0 yesterday, when playing on PC via Steam, the game now seems to be missing a number of \"New Items\" pop-up windows that display which items I just collected.\n\nExample include:\n- Buying items in the shop\n- Collecting the respective ions from daily and weekly missions I've completed\n- Collecting the rewards from daily or weekly missions\n- Collecting rewards from the \"Witness to All\" wheel event (not shown in attached video)\n- Daily login reward from \"Gifts from Mythag\" event\n- Items received after completing or reenacting combat stages\n- Collecting \"Curriculum\" rewards\n\nThe few places that do appear to display it correctly for me on PC are Interlude: Assignment rewards, and the daily free 20 silver claimed in the shop.  (And I guess technically the \"Exchange Results\" screen for box events like GHelot's, since those did not display a \"New Item\" pop-up for anything besides the event SR wheel.)\n\nIf this is a new feature, then I don't see any means of toggling it under Settings.  And it's not fully consistent as to *when* it happens.", "timestamp": "2026-07-28T01:30:09.840000+00:00", "thread_id": "1531473810539413685", "edited_timestamp": "2026-07-28T01:31:10.809000+00:00", "attachments": [{"id": "1531473811503972372", "filename": "Popups_missing_2.5.3.1.mp4", "content_type": "video/mp4", "size": 9920179, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1531473810539413685/1531473811503972372/Popups_missing_2.5.3.1.mp4?ex=6a6957a2&is=6a680622&hm=89f64693050309eb428c4009b1261af913f180b0a75f3e94a00999a937498bb1&"}]}
{"id": "1531457506289782856", "channel_id": "1531457506289782856", "author_id": "1046572178084208780", "author_name": "suki_ilovechuuyafrombsd", "content": "I hopped onto morimens today, and when I opened genesis lotans event it just didn't show up, and instead my home page for the game did. I don't know if anyone else has this issue but everything else works fine besides the background. I restarted the game a couple times and deleted the cache however it didn't fix it. <:Horla_cry:1357186646294138890>", "timestamp": "2026-07-28T00:25:22.604000+00:00", "thread_id": "1531457506289782856", "attachments": [{"id": "1531457506730180618", "filename": "Screenshot_20260727-202112.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 1396908, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1531457506289782856/1531457506730180618/Screenshot_20260727-202112.png?ex=6a694872&is=6a67f6f2&hm=89a0bd60f93f43ab43cb717d996c7460b96bd51b9689a53194331f218842f6d5&"}]}
