{"id": "1531557152177651932", "channel_id": "1531280359252037722", "author_id": "264894122148495362", "author_name": "sirtealot", "content": "This comparison makes zero sense\nSlay the Spire is a deck building roguelike game, you don't start a run with a specific build in mind in the first place \nMorimens has its entire deck building happen in the team building phase, your lineup has to be fully functional without relying on the low chance of getting a specific relic, because the very first fight you enter expects it to be fully functional, unlike the rising difficulty in StS\n\nJust like no one uses Pollux as a source of vulnerability just because his image has it, GLotan's image also cannot be considered a part of her kit", "timestamp": "2026-07-28T07:01:20.035000+00:00", "type": 19, "thread_id": "1531280359252037722", "mentions": ["98445241870188544"], "reply_to": "1531498594631155712"}
